# Example environment configuration for the Forum MSE 2026 UI.
#
# This file DOCUMENTS the configuration the UI is expected to need.
# Only safe, public, non-secret placeholders belong here.
# The real ".env" file is git-ignored and must never be committed.
#
# NOTE: Angular does NOT automatically read ".env" files. This file is purely
# documentation of expected configuration at this stage. The actual runtime
# configuration mechanism (e.g. Angular environment files, build-time
# substitution, or Docker entrypoint config) will be introduced in a later
# Angular/Docker iteration.

# Base URL of the backend HTTP API the UI talks to.
BACKEND_BASE_URL=http://localhost:9000
